#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Link the Membership Level to a specific <strong>Pricelist</strong> (e.g., €0 "
"for coworking days if included in Unlimited).<br/>\n"
"                        → When a client buys the subscription, they are "
"automatically assigned the level and related pricelist. On their portal, "
"they’ll see eligible coworking access at the correct price (such as €0/day "
"with Unlimited).<br/>\n"
"                        <br/>"
msgstr ""
"Hubungkan Tingkat Keanggotaan ke <strong>Daftar Harga</strong> tertentu "
"(misalnya, €0 untuk hari coworking jika termasuk dalam paket Tanpa Batas)"
".<br/>\n"
"                        → Saat membeli langganan, klien otomatis ditetapkan "
"ke tingkat keanggotaan dan daftar harga terkait. Di portal mereka, klien "
"akan melihat akses coworking yang memenuhi syarat dengan harga yang benar "
"(seperti €0/hari dengan paket Tanpa Batas).<br/>\n"
"                        <br/>"

