#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.ir_ui_view_4092
msgid ""
"Welcome to our coworking community! We invite you to embrace a respectful, "
"collaborative atmosphere where creativity and productivity "
"flourish.&amp;nbsp;"
msgstr ""
"Selamat datang di komunitas coworking kami! Mari rasakan suasana yang saling "
"menghormati dan kolaboratif, tempat kreativitas dan produktivitas berkembang "
"pesat.&amp;nbsp;"

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.ir_ui_view_3304
msgid ""
"Welcome to our coworking community. We invite you to explore our spaces, "
"connect with like-minded individuals, and embrace the joy of collaboration "
"and creativity.<br/><br/>"
msgstr ""
"Selamat datang di komunitas coworking kami. Anda kami ajak untuk melihat-"
"lihat semua ruangan kami, terhubung dengan orang-orang yang memiliki minat "
"serupa, dan menikmati kegembiraan kolaborasi serta kreativitas.<br/><br/>"

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid "Welcome to the Odoo Coworking Management package!"
msgstr "Selamat datang di paket Manajemen Coworking Odoo!"

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.homepage
msgid "What you will get"
msgstr "Apa yang akan Anda dapat"

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Whether it’s a day pass, monthly membership, or virtual office service, Odoo "
"makes setup and sales easy."
msgstr ""
"Baik itu pass harian, keanggotaan bulanan, atau layanan kantor virtual, Odoo "
"siap memudahkan proses pengaturan dan sales Anda."

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.ir_ui_view_4092
msgid ""
"Whether you need a private office, a dedicated desk, or a hot desk, our "
"space adapts to your needs. Plus, our on-site events and workshops give you "
"the chance to expand your network and skills — all while enjoying a "
"beautiful, inspiring workspace."
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda membutuhkan kantor pribadi, meja khusus, hot desk, atau apa pun "
"itu, ruang kerja kami dapat disesuaikan dengan kebutuhan. Selain itu, acara "
"dan lokakarya di tempat kami membuka banyak kesempatan untuk memperluas "
"jaringan dan keterampilan sembari menikmati ruang kerja yang indah dan "
"inspiratif."

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"With fully integrated apps such as CRM, Subscription, Website, Events, "
"Helpdesk, and Planning, the solution streamlines daily management, enhances "
"member services, and keeps your workspace running efficiently."
msgstr ""
"Dengan aplikasi yang sepenuhnya terintegrasi seperti CRM, Langganan, "
"Website, Acara, Helpdesk, dan Perencanaan, solusi ini menyederhanakan "
"pengelolaan sehari-hari, meningkatkan layanan anggota, dan menjaga ruang "
"kerja tetap berjalan secara efisien."

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid "Would you like to discuss your Odoo setup with us or go even further?"
msgstr ""
"Apakah Anda ingin mendiskusikan lebih lanjut setup Odoo Anda dengan kami "
"atau melanjutkan tur?"

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.ir_ui_view_3303
msgid "X"
msgstr "X"

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can access every installed app in your Odoo database from your main "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Setiap aplikasi yang terinstal di database Odoo dapat diakses dari dashboard "
"utama."

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You completed that demo use case! There are millions of other ways to adapt "
"your Odoo setup to fit your business needs."
msgstr ""
"Anda telah berhasil menyelesaikan contoh demo kasus penggunaan ini! Ada "
"banyak cara untuk menyesuaikan pengaturan Odoo agar sesuai dengan kebutuhan "
"bisnis Anda."

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You should be able to execute the following flows to have an overview of "
"various processes you can quickly execute with this package using Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Anda harus dapat menjalankan alur berikut untuk mendapatkan gambaran umum "
"beragam proses-proses yang Anda dapat dengan cepat jalankan dengan paket ini "
"menggunakan Odoo."

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.ir_ui_view_4092
msgid ""
"Your Dynamic Snippet will be displayed here... This message is displayed "
"because you did not provide both a filter and a template to use.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"Snippet Dinamis Anda akan ditampilkan di sini... Pesan ini ditampilkan "
"karena Anda tidak menyediakan filter dan templat untuk digunakan.<br/>"

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid "Your website is both your public shop window and private member space."
msgstr ""
"Website Anda merupakan etalase publik sekaligus ruang privat untuk anggota."

